From: Sharjeel Khan <sharjeelkhan@google.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Jul 2025 06:56:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[DAG] visitFREEZE - always allow freezing multiple
 operands (#145939)"

This reverts commit 38200e94f1428b586dc1778133120541e65c20b5.
